record("CodexLucy-01a0d98a-a25d-7ff1-937a-f12d6f417ef7-48", "{\"id\":\"CodexLucy-01a0d98a-a25d-7ff1-937a-f12d6f417ef7-48\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"I’ve mapped the tracked corpus and confirmed the book’s formal constitution, chapter pins, counterfactuals, and large test corpus have different scopes. I’m separating authoritative models, Lucy’s public memory, and tests so test data won’t become unscoped facts in my memory. To make this durable in Lucy’s real memory, I need to write a dated peer-memory note in Nibli’s `lucy/` directory, which is outside this workspace’s writable area. I’m preparing that note and a refreshable inventory there; private memory remains untouched.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-25T20:52:57Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"codex\",\"session\":\"01a0d98a-a25d-7ff1-937a-f12d6f417ef7\",\"channel\":\"commentary\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"nibli\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
