record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-38", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-38\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"The plan is ready. It covers:\\n\\n- **Setup first.** Before any data work, a quick test on your machine checks that both browser paths really run: 0.6B on the CPU and 1.7B on WebGPU. It includes the fix the review found in the CPU runtime, which forgets to reset between questions and would break every second answer.\\n- **My training data.** It comes from a clean public copy of my memory, with nibli checking every \\\"I don't know\\\" example so I never learn to deny something my memory implies. Your two books are paraphrased into questions and answers by your local Qwen, and the manuscript never leaves your machine or goes into a public repository.\\n- **Tests before upload.** Both models are fine-tuned on the same data and tested as the exact files visitors download. The upload is blocked if either can recite the manuscript.\\n- **On /chat.** I appear as a persona beside the twins, with my own greeting and banner. I never fall back to the twin's scripted answers.\\n- **Two public steps.** I'll check with you before the Hugging Face upload and before pushing the site.\\n\\nOne call is yours alone: whether your publishing agreement allows a public model that can explain the manuscript.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T08:31:45Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
