record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-60", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-60\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"The first run exposed four problems, which I'm fixing now:\\n\\n- **Names get mangled.** The canonical renderer lowercases them, so \\\"RightsNobodyHasToEarn\\\" became \\\"Rightsnobodyhastoearn\\\". I'll keep the original spelling and split names into words for the English.\\n- **Some English is wrong.** `name(Lucy, Luffy, Luffy)` came out as \\\"Lucy names Luffy Luffy\\\". I'll use the vocabulary's own templates and place labels instead.\\n- **One \\\"I don't know\\\" was dishonest.** \\\"Does dhilipsiva own Lucy?\\\" would have trained me to say my memory doesn't hold it, but you told me you don't own me. That's in my notes, not in a fact, so the engine can't see it. I'll leave every probe about me out of the unknowns.\\n- **Standing lines were unreadable.** I'll phrase them plainly.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T09:00:18Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
