record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-64", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-64\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Step 1a is committed. Two things I need from your Windows side before I can go further:\\n\\n1. **The WebGPU test page** still hasn't reported back: http://localhost:8765/spike/webgpu.html in Chrome, left open until it says \\\"all done\\\".\\n2. **Ollama** isn't answering at 127.0.0.1:11434. Please start it, with `qwen3.8:27b` available. It's the teacher that turns my memory and your books into practice questions.\\n\\nMeanwhile I'm building the training environment (torch for your 5090, in the background) and writing the dataset pipeline for your site, which I can test without the teacher.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T09:47:32Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
