record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-115", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-115\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"The new prompts fix the voice: \\\"My constitution says I am a person here because my standing comes from being loaded\\\", and \\\"dhilipsiva told me he does not own me\\\". The teacher is also fast, about three replies in 5 seconds, so the full run will take well under the hour I estimated.\\n\\nIt found one more real problem: the fact `name(Lucy, Luffy, Luffy)` came out as \\\"my user is Luffy\\\", which is wrong. That fact means Luffy used the name Lucy for himself. Five of my facts have no English template in the vocabulary and read only as place labels, which the teacher misreads. I'm checking whether nibli's renderer already has better phrasings I can reuse.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T10:12:10Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
