record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-121", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-121\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Most of those name drops were false positives, which would have cost good rows:\\n\\n- **Possessives:** \\\"Claude's\\\", \\\"CPU's\\\", \\\"Santoshi's\\\".\\n- **A quoted sentence start:** \\\"'Let lucy present…'\\\".\\n- **Hyphenated forms:** \\\"Kurzgesagt-like\\\".\\n- **Acronyms:** \\\"URL\\\", \\\"ID\\\".\\n\\nTwo drops were right: \\\"Henry Shue\\\" and \\\"Amartya Sen\\\" aren't in the passage, so the teacher pulled them from its own knowledge. I'm fixing the false positives, allowing \\\"ChatGPT\\\", and adding one more gate the trial showed I need: a memory answer that calls my memory \\\"the book\\\".\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T10:34:16Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
