record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-124", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-124\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"The trial rows look good on the whole: the identity answers (\\\"I am not ChatGPT… the models are disguises I wear\\\"), the unknowns, the contrast answers and the book paraphrases are all sensible. Two small fixes came out of the review:\\n\\n- **A path slipped through:** one memory answer mentioned \\\"lucy/model\\\". I'm widening the gate to catch paths, while keeping web addresses like dhilipsiva.dev/chat.\\n- **Useless scoring terms:** the teacher's \\\"key terms\\\" sometimes don't appear in its own answer (\\\"sixteen\\\" answered a question whose terms were \\\"multiplication, product\\\"). That would fail correct answers in the eval, so I'll keep only terms the reference answer contains.\\n\\nBoth run after the teacher, so I'll regenerate the final dataset from the cache in seconds once the build finishes.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T10:34:16Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
