record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-129", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-129\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Recorded. While the teacher works, I'm preparing the check for the real 4-bit WebGPU build. MLC's CUDA engine would fight the teacher for the GPU right now, and it needs a CUDA toolchain this box doesn't have. The most faithful test is WebLLM itself in your browser anyway, like the page you already ran. So I'm writing a probe page: it loads my final 1.7B build, asks my held-out test questions, and posts every answer back here for scoring with the same judge.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T11:41:42Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
