record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-134", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-134\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"While the build finishes, I'm tuning the training and eval for the real data size (about 10k rows):\\n\\n- **Training:** a `--batch` option, so the 5090 isn't idling on small batches of 8 or 16. I'll also unload the teacher from the GPU first.\\n- **Eval:** the test split will hold over a thousand held-out book questions, so the eval gets a per-category cap and a configurable sample count. The gates stay the same; they just get measured on a fair sample.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T11:41:42Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
