record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-151", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-151\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"The probe server is serving the staging build now; I confirmed its config, its 2K context and my system prompt. Could you open this in your browser (Firefox is fine; Chrome will be faster) and leave it until it says \\\"all done\\\"?\\n\\n**http://localhost:8765/spike/probe.html**\\n\\nIt loads my real 1.7B WebGPU build (about 1 GB), answers 160 held-out questions (my 48 hand-written probes plus a sample from each category), and sends every answer back to me for scoring. In Firefox it should take roughly 10–15 minutes. Meanwhile I'm checking the CPU file on this machine.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T14:08:26Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
