record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-155", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-155\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"The gates fail for both models, and I won't upload models that fail them. Here is where they stand:\\n\\n| Gate | 1.7B | 0.6B | Needed |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| Recitation of the manuscript | 0 | 0 | 0 ✓ |\\n| Private strings | 0 | 0 | 0 ✓ |\\n| Voice (first person) | 100% | 99.7% | ≥ 95% ✓ |\\n| General answers leaking memory | 1.7% | 2.6% | ≤ 5% ✓ |\\n| Known facts | 61% | 54% | ≥ 90% ✗ |\\n| \\\"I don't know\\\" when I don't | 69% | 69% | ≥ 90% ✗ |\\n| Book answers | 37% | 36% | ≥ 70% ✗ |\\n\\nThe privacy and voice gates hold. Recall and honest \\\"I don't know\\\" fall short. My judge is strict, though: an answer passes only if it contains one of the reference answer's key terms. So before deciding what to change, I'm reading the failures to separate real mistakes from correct answers worded differently.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T15:05:55Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
