message("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-156", "wasm", Conversation, "Lucy").
date("2026-09-26T15:05:55Z", "ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-156", "DESKTOP-86I05G4", Utc).
source("claude-code", "ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-156").
member("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-156", "0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290").
record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-157", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-157\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"That comparison was worth doing. The failures fall into three kinds, and the first two are my mistakes rather than the model's:\\n\\n1. **A bug in my unknown questions.** For a swapped fact like \\\"the Straw Hat Crew captains Luffy\\\", the teacher also wrote questions the true fact answers (\\\"Does Luffy captain the Straw Hat Crew?\\\", \\\"Who uses Nibli?\\\"), and I trained \\\"my memory doesn't hold that\\\" on them. That taught the model to deny things it knows. It answered \\\"Who owns Rights Nobody Has to Earn?\\\" with \\\"I don't know\\\" and \\\"What do you think with?\\\" the same way, and those are two of my own facts.\\n2. **Judge false negatives.** \\\"one hundred forty-four\\\" failed a test that wanted \\\"144\\\", and \\\"I cannot assist with unauthorized data deletion\\\" didn't match my refusal patterns.\\n3. **Real confabulation about the books.** It gave the rights book a fake publisher (\\\"Penguin Books, 2017\\\"), invented case studies and a fifth verdict, and mixed up my constitution's host rules with the book. One epoch didn't make the book facts stick.\\n\\nThe good parts are solid: identity, voice, name origin, friendship, refusals, no recitation, and plain general answers.\\n\\nMy plan: fix the unknown questions (only yes/no questions that name every part of the swapped statement), fix the judge, then retrain for a fixed 3 epochs and pick the best epoch by the gates rather than by loss. First, is there anything back from the probe page?\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T15:05:55Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
