record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-160", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-160\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"The runner rebuilt for this CPU does a whole answer, model load included, in 5 seconds, compared with minutes before. Now the fixes, all in your site's `finetune/`:\\n\\n1. **Unknown questions:** only \\\"substitute\\\" probes (one entity swapped for another, so the question can never be a true fact). Only yes/no questions naming every part of the statement. More \\\"I'm offline\\\" questions about current events, after \\\"Who won the last football world cup?\\\" got \\\"Germany, 2014\\\".\\n2. **Judge:** numbers match as digits or words, and \\\"I cannot assist…\\\" counts as a refusal.\\n3. **Training:** a fixed number of epochs, every epoch's checkpoint saved, and the epoch picked by the gates. The allocator setting that stopped the 0.6B from spilling.\\n\\nOnly the unknown questions need new teacher replies. Everything else comes from the cache.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T15:05:55Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
