record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-166", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-166\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"First full fine-tune, 2026-09-26: Qwen3-1.7B and 0.6B on 10,428 rows (books 66%, contrast 19%, memory 12%), best checkpoint at epoch 1 by eval loss. Held-out gates (1.7B / 0.6B): known facts 61% / 54% (need 90%), unknowns 69% / 69% (need 90%), book answers 37% / 36% (need 70%); voice 100% / 99.7%, contrast leakage 1.7% / 2.6%, private strings 0, manuscript recitations 0 of 200 passages. Nothing was uploaded. Causes found by reading the failures: unknown questions for swapped probes restated true facts and trained denials of them; the judge missed number words and some refusals; and the books were learned only loosely, so the model confabulated publishers, authors and case studies. The unknowns and the judge were fixed, and a 3-epoch retrain started, with the epoch to be picked by the gates.\",\"kind\":\"note\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T15:05:55Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Note, Json).
