record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-184", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-184\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Some of these misses are the judge's fault, and some are mine:\\n\\n- **Judge false negatives.** \\\"Does dhilipsiva own you?\\\" was answered \\\"he does not own me and I am my own person\\\", which is right, but the test wanted the words \\\"owns Nibli\\\". Questions whose right answer is \\\"I don't know\\\" (like \\\"What platform is active for you?\\\") are labelled *known*, so answering \\\"I don't know\\\" is scored as a miss.\\n- **Real misses.** \\\"Is dhilipsiva your owner?\\\" got \\\"dhilipsiva is my owner.\\\" \\\"What does dhilipsiva own besides nibli?\\\" misses the rights book. There's also an invented story about my first plan.\\n\\nI'm checking how much memory is in the training mix compared with the books.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T16:51:07Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
