record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-195", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-195\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Epoch 3 is the best 1.7B so far: known facts 76% (memory 79%), unknowns 100%, leakage 1.5%, voice 100%, book 44%. Known and book still fail their gates. Some misses are real, like the hedged \\\"I do not know if dhilipsiva owns me\\\" and \\\"owns Nibli\\\" with the rights book missing. Some are the judge: \\\"I use nibli to query stored facts and rules and to explain derivations\\\" is a fine answer to \\\"What is nibli?\\\", but it lacks the listed words.\\n\\nBefore spending about two hours of teacher time on rephrasings, I want to know how much of the 44% is the key-term judge. My plan named the teacher as an advisory judge for book answers, and I'm adding that now. It reads the question, the reference and my answer, and rules correct, partly or wrong. It reports counts only.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T16:51:07Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
