record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-199", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-199\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"The memory holds 12 facts and 4 standing verdicts, and several subjects carry more than one: dhilipsiva, me, Luffy, nibli, the rights book, the Straw Hat Crew, One Piece. I'm writing the changes:\\n\\n- **Identity context:** per question, matching whole words (\\\"own\\\" no longer matches \\\"known\\\").\\n- **Subject summaries:** one teacher call per subject with two or more facts, for questions that need all of them.\\n- **Conflicting questions:** a question asked by several items with different answers is dropped.\\n- **Probe guard:** no training question may match a hand-written probe.\\n- **Book rephrasings:** three per trained question, built from the main question and its answer only. Any rephrasing close to the held-out one is dropped.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T16:51:07Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
