record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-219", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-219\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"All clean. No training answer shares 8 words with the manuscript, the private canary is absent, no test question appears anywhere in training, and no training question near-copies a probe. 18 questions do share 8 words with the manuscript. Questions are inputs with no training loss, but \\\"only paraphrases of it are kept\\\" should hold for them too, so the gate now checks questions as well. Then the general questions go to ×2, a final offline rebuild, and training.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T16:51:07Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
