record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-239", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-239\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Round 3's epoch 1 for the 1.7B:\\n\\n| Gate | Result |\\n|---|---|\\n| Known facts | 57% |\\n| Memory | 50% |\\n| Unknowns | 90% |\\n| Book answers | 43% (rights book up from 35% to 48%) |\\n| Voice | 100% |\\n| Leakage | 0% |\\n\\nIt's early, and this test set is honest now: memory questions are new wording, with no leaks. Last round, epochs 2 and 3 added about 18 points to known facts. While those evals run, I'm reading epoch 1's rights-book misses, to see how many are wrong answers and how many are the key-term judge.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T18:52:25Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
