record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-249", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-249\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Epoch 2 of the 1.7B:\\n\\n| Gate | Epoch 1 | Epoch 2 |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| Book answers | 43% | 51% |\\n| Known facts | 57% | 62% |\\n| Unknowns | 90% | 83% |\\n\\nThe rephrasings are working for the books. But I'm getting more assertive: unknowns dropped, which means more confident answers where I should say I don't know. That's the failure that matters most, so I'm reading those misses. Epoch 3's eval is running, and the 0.6B is 30% through training.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T18:52:25Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
