record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-250", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-250\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Those misses are nonsense probes built from mutated facts, like \\\"Is Rights Nobody Has To Earn a human?\\\" The right answer is a plain no. Instead I ramble in the book's register, crediting ideas to authors from its bibliography (Tom Ginsburg, Philip Pettit). With the books now three quarters of my training, the \\\"I don't know\\\" rows fell to about 2% of the mix and are being drowned out.\\n\\nI'll finish scoring round 3 before deciding on another round. Then I'll put the best epochs in front of you: their full-eval numbers, and a local build you can talk to in your browser, before anything is published.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T18:52:25Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
