record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-253", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-253\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Round 3's 1.7B, all three epochs:\\n\\n| Gate | Epoch 1 | Epoch 2 | Epoch 3 |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| Book answers | 43% | 51% | 50% |\\n| Known facts | 57% | 62% | 62% |\\n| Unknowns | 90% | 83% | 78% |\\n\\nEpoch 3 buys nothing and loses honesty, so epoch 2 is the 1.7B pick. The 0.6B is halfway through training.\\n\\nI'm starting the full gate eval on the 1.7B now: 150 questions per category, 3 samples plus a greedy answer, the 200-passage recitation test, the private canary, and the source-aware advisory judge. The judge runs last, by which time the GPU will have room for the teacher.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T18:52:25Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
