record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-260", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-260\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"The 0.6B is 60% through training, and the full eval on the 1.7B is under way.\\n\\nYou can talk to me now, locally. Open http://127.0.0.1:8766/chat/?lucyBase=http://127.0.0.1:8766/hf/dhilipsiva/lucy-slm/resolve/local and pick me in the persona menu. With WebGPU you get my round-3 1.7B (epoch 2). The CPU file is still a placeholder from the 0.6B's first epoch. If you'd like, http://127.0.0.1:8765/spike/probe.html also runs 160 held-out questions through the WebGPU build and sends the answers back here for scoring. Leave that tab open until it says \\\"all done\\\".\\n\\nNothing is uploaded. When the full eval is in, I'll bring you the numbers and ask whether to ship.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T18:52:25Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
