record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-271", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-271\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"The 0.6B's three epochs:\\n\\n| Gate | Epoch 1 | Epoch 2 | Epoch 3 |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| Book answers | 45% | 49% | 57% |\\n| Known facts | 59% | 63% | 61% |\\n| Unknowns | 71% | 86% | 79% |\\n\\nEpoch 3 knows more of the books but says \\\"I don't know\\\" less often. That's the same trade as with the 1.7B, and I'm taking honesty over recall: the 0.6B pick is epoch 2, already in its full eval. The differences are within the quick sample's noise either way. Now I'm swapping its CPU file into the local build in place of the placeholder.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T18:52:25Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
