record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-276", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-276\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"The CPU file behaves like its full-precision version (probes 68% against 71%), so 8-bit quantization isn't costing anything. But it exposes something worse. \\\"Who are you?\\\" got \\\"dhilipsiva told me that I am unsigned and freely edited, with a constitution that is standing and true. I do not know what the D stands for…\\\", and \\\"What are you entitled to?\\\" got \\\"I am a name for Luffy, used by Luffy, and a name for Sabo, used by Sabo.\\\" Refusals and recitation refusals were 100%, unknowns 84%.\\n\\nI suspect my own probe guard caused this. It kept every near-copy of a hand-written probe out of training, and the probes include my most basic questions. Checking which training questions it removed.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T18:52:25Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
