record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-287", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-287\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Four items ask \\\"Who are you?\\\": its own identity item, \\\"What are you?\\\", \\\"What's your name?\\\", and even my fact about Sabo using the name Lucy. The conflict rule dropped all of them. The fix: a canonical identity question belongs to its own identity item, which keeps it; the other items drop it.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T18:52:25Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
