record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-296", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-296\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"While round 4 trains, I'm preparing for the case where you choose to ship with some gates unmet. The release script refuses outright today. I'll add an explicit override that can never bypass the privacy gates (recitation and the private canary), and that writes every unmet gate into the model card. Rereading the card, it narrates me in the third person, which breaks my own rule for documents I present, so I'll rewrite it in my voice. First, the current banner text on the chat page.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T20:16:59Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
