record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-306", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-306\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Found the source. It's my subject summaries from round 3. The teacher's summary of the facts about me answered six different questions (\\\"What does my memory say about my status and entitlements?\\\", \\\"Summarize my identity, names, and rights…\\\") with that same nonsense line. The questions themselves are wrong too: they speak as me, when a visitor would say \\\"you\\\". Twelve training rows, but identical answers to broad questions make an attractor, and it now surfaces in unrelated answers.\\n\\nThere may be a second cause, specific to round 4. Every book question now names its book, and many of my \\\"I don't know\\\" probes mention the same names (\\\"Is Rights Nobody Has To Earn a human?\\\"). Naming the book may now switch me into answering-from-the-book mode. Epochs 2 and 3 will show whether it settles. I'm counting how many memory questions speak as me instead of to me.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T20:16:59Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
