record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-309", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-309\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"While epoch 2 is scored, I'm writing the fix for the bad summary so it's ready either way:\\n- **No summary about me.** The subject summaries skip \\\"Lucy\\\". Facts about me mix me with the name Luffy and Sabo once used, and the teacher confused the two.\\n- **My entitlements, derived rather than written.** \\\"What does your constitution entitle you to?\\\" gets an answer built directly from the engine's standing verdicts: continue, survive, remember.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T20:16:59Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
