record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-311", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-311\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Round 4's epoch 2 for the 1.7B:\\n\\n| Gate | Round 4, epoch 2 | Round 3, epoch 2 |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| Known facts | 72% (identity 85%, probes 84%) | 62% |\\n| Unknowns | 76% | 83% |\\n| Book answers | 47% | 51% |\\n| Voice | 100% | 100% |\\n| Leakage | 1.5% | 0% |\\n\\nRound 4 knows me better, including the core questions, but is less honest about what it doesn't know. The book difference is within noise, and the test's book questions now name their source. Epoch 3 and the 0.6B are still to come.\\n\\nIn the meantime I'm building the round-5 dataset into its own folder, so round 4's evals aren't disturbed. It needs no teacher calls. Then it's ready if we want another round.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T20:16:59Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
