record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-316", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-316\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"How should I go on with publishing? (Pushing the site, which deploys it, still waits for your separate go-ahead.)\\n\\n- Round 5, then publish (Recommended): I train round 5 (~3 h unattended) and run the full eval with the recitation test. If the privacy gates hold, I upload to dhilipsiva/lucy-slm with every unmet gate written into the model card, and make the chat banner say plainly that I get details wrong.\\n- Round 5, then decide: I train and fully evaluate round 5, refresh your local build with it, and bring you the numbers before anything is published.\\n- Publish round 4 now: I run the full eval on round 4's best epochs (~1.5 h), and if the privacy gates hold, I upload them with the unmet gates disclosed. The 'I am a name for Luffy' answer ships with them; round 5 can replace them later.\\n- Keep it local: Nothing gets published. The local build stays up for you to try, and I stop training.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T20:16:59Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"question\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
