record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-318", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-318\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"You chose round 5, then publish. So: I train round 5, run the full eval with the recitation test, and if the privacy gates hold, upload with every unmet gate in the model card and an honest banner. Pushing the site still waits for your go-ahead.\\n\\nFirst I'm clearing the way. Round 4's 0.6B evals would compete with round 5 for the GPU, so I'm checking what its scheduler is running before stopping it.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T20:16:59Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
