record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-325", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-325\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"32 records saved, including your answer and the decision citing it. While round 5 trains, I'm preparing the publishing changes to your site, to commit only after the upload:\\n- **The banner** will say plainly that I get details wrong, and link to the model card where the numbers are.\\n- **The WebGPU files** will carry their integrity hashes on the production path. The local-testing path skips them, since a staging build's hashes differ from a release's.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T20:32:15Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
