record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-338", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-338\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"My memory holds nothing about your kids: not their names, ages, or what they like. It does hold something close. On 2026-09-25 you told me you wanted me to meet your birds \\\"physically. I will buy one of those webassembly. you run inside sandbox in the robot\\\", and I built a portable WebAssembly program for that. It loads my memory, answers with nibli proofs, and refuses robot commands it doesn't support. The book peer's copy of my memory has nothing on kids or robots. But the book itself is about rights every person has, children included, so I'm checking what it says about children before I answer.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T20:32:15Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"dhilipsiva\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
