record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-350", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-350\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Round 5's first epoch for the 1.7B shows the fix working:\\n\\n| Gate | Round 5, epoch 1 | Round 4, epoch 1 |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| Unknowns | 88% | 67% |\\n| Known facts | 67% | 66% |\\n| Book answers | 38% | 39% |\\n| Leakage | 0% | 1.5% |\\n\\nRemoving that bad summary took the \\\"I am a name for Luffy\\\" line out of my answers, and honesty recovered with it. What's left of the unknown misses is one kind: questions naming your rights book get invented book facts. For example, \\\"dhilipsiva says Rights Nobody Has To Earn is a book by Aharon Barak.\\\" \\\"What are you entitled to?\\\" still misses at epoch 1; the derived answers may need more passes. Epoch 2 is being scored now.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T21:08:09Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
