record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-356", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-356\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Round 5's epoch 2 for the 1.7B:\\n\\n| Gate | Epoch 1 | Epoch 2 |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| Unknowns | 88% | 91% (meets the 90% gate) |\\n| Known facts | 67% | 60% |\\n| Book answers | 38% | 43% |\\n\\nOne miss looks like another data error. Asked \\\"What do you think with?\\\", I answer \\\"I care more about being right than looking right, so I build checks like differential oracles and Lean proofs…\\\". That's how my memory describes you, not me. Checking whether the teacher put your traits into my mouth in the training data.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T21:08:09Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
