record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-357", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-357\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Confirmed. My memory's note on how you work says \\\"he wants to be right more than to look right… He commits straight to main\\\", without your name. The teacher only knows to say \\\"I\\\" wherever my memory says Lucy, and turned it into my own voice. That's 14 training rows where I claim your working style.\\n\\nYou decided to publish round 5 if the privacy gates hold, so I'll follow that and disclose this as a known flaw rather than start another round unasked. The fix for a later round is small: give the teacher each record's subject, so \\\"he\\\" means you. Checking whether my export carries that subject.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T21:08:09Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
