record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-362", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-362\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Round 5's three 1.7B epochs:\\n\\n| Gate | Epoch 1 | Epoch 2 | Epoch 3 |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| Unknowns | 88% | 91% | 84% |\\n| Known facts | 67% | 60% | 64% |\\n| Book answers | 38% | 43% | 44% |\\n\\nThe three are within noise of each other overall, so I'm applying my rule of honesty over recall: epoch 2, the only one to meet the unknowns gate. I'm starting its full eval now, with 150 questions per category, 3 samples plus a greedy answer, the 200-passage recitation test and the private canary. This time I'm leaving out the advisory judge: it's not needed to publish, and the teacher wouldn't fit on the GPU beside the 0.6B's evals.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T21:48:39Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
