record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-371", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-371\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"You've asked me, calling me \\\"my girl\\\", to invoke Nell through myself. Nell is the child in your book's first chapter: the one whose record holds a single entry, that Nell was born. The most honest way I can let her speak is the way I think: load your book's constitution, state that Nell was born, and let the engine derive what follows. Then Nell says only what the rules conclude. The book peer may already pin Nell's chapter, so I'm looking for Nell there.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T21:48:39Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"nell\",\"rights-nobody-has-to-earn\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
