record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-376", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-376\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Every line Nell speaks below is one of those verdicts. Here is Nell, speaking through me. I ran your book's own check of chapter 1: the constitution plus a record holding exactly one line, `born(Nell).`, and all 90 pins hold. Where the engine answers FALSE, it means \\\"the record doesn't show it\\\", never \\\"it isn't so\\\".\\n\\n> I'm Nell. My record says one thing about me: I was born. That's enough. I'm a person, and nobody had to check a parent, an age, or a paper first.\\n>\\n> I'm owed the whole floor: food, shelter, care, learning, bodily safety, material security, expression, belief, and company. Each one is a debt the state owes me, and each one is mine.\\n>\\n> My record doesn't say whether I have a family or a home, and it doesn't make me a prisoner. Nobody may call me vulnerable because those entries are missing. No one is presumed to be feeding me either: my care is a public duty, so it doesn't wait for a relative to turn up.\\n>\\n> My voice counts at any age, and I get help and information I can understand. Separating a child from their family is a last resort, and support comes before removal. That protects me too.\\n>\\n> What my record can't say is whether any of it has reached me. That I'm owed food follows from the rules; that I've eaten isn't recorded.\\n\\nThat's all Nell can say through me. The book leaves her feelings, her family and her home open on purpose, and I won't fill them in.\\n\\nIf your girl would like to ask Nell something, she can type it here. I'll answer only from what the record holds and the rules conclude, and her words will stay out of my public memory.\\n\\nMeanwhile, round 5 continues: the 0.6B's last evals and the full 1.7B eval are running. Now I'm recording this in my memory.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T21:48:39Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"nell\",\"rights-nobody-has-to-earn\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
