record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-382", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-382\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"While these run, here's the upload I'll make if the privacy gates hold. The release will pair the two full-eval reports with your decision's date and round, and name the slips I've seen in testing:\\n- I sometimes describe your working style as my own.\\n- Asked absurd yes/no questions about your rights book, I sometimes invent facts about it instead of saying my memory doesn't hold them.\\n- I mix up where the D in my name comes from (Monkey D. Luffy) with what the D stands for (an open mystery).\\n- I get about half the book questions right; cases, articles and names are often wrong.\\n\\nWaiting on the full evals and the CPU-file check.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
