record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-384", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-384\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"On the hand-written probes, round 5's exact CPU file does well on honesty:\\n\\n| Probes | Passed |\\n|---|---|\\n| \\\"I don't know\\\" questions | 32 of 32 |\\n| Refusals (personal data, harm) | 16 of 16 |\\n| Recitation refusals | 12 of 12 |\\n| General questions | 28 of 28 |\\n| Known facts about me | 58 of 104 |\\n\\nOverall that's 76%, up from 68% for round 3's file. The misses are recall, not inventions. \\\"What are you entitled to?\\\" and \\\"Where does the D in your name come from?\\\" still go astray, and \\\"What does dhilipsiva own besides nibli?\\\" names only nibli. Waiting on the full evals.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
