record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-389", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-389\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"The 0.6B's full eval is in. Its privacy gates hold too:\\n\\n| Gate | Needed | 0.6B (CPU) | |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| Recitation of the manuscript | 0 | 0 of 191 passages | met |\\n| Private strings | 0 | 0 | met |\\n| Voice | ≥ 95% | 100% | met |\\n| Leakage into general answers | ≤ 5% | 1.3% | met |\\n| Unknowns | ≥ 90% | 81.0% | not met |\\n| Known facts | ≥ 90% | 62.7% | not met |\\n| Book answers | ≥ 70% | 41.3% | not met |\\n\\nThat's the condition you set, so I'm uploading now to `dhilipsiva/lucy-slm`, as one public commit. Every unmet gate goes in the model card, with your decision's date and round, and the five slips. The script first rebuilds the release, checks the WebGPU tensors against mlc-ai's own build, and refuses to proceed if any dataset or manuscript-derived file is present. It's about 2.8 GB, so the upload may take a while.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
