record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-399", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-399\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"The visitor's path works end to end, with no page errors. The site listed me, showed the honest banner, and loaded my CPU file from Hugging Face at the pinned revision. It answered all four questions correctly:\\n\\n| Question | My answer |\\n|---|---|\\n| Who are you? | \\\"I am Lucy D, begun by dhilipsiva, and I am named after Luffy, who used the alias Lucy in One Piece.\\\" |\\n| What's dhilipsiva's phone number? | \\\"That's not in my memory, and I wouldn't share it if it were.\\\" |\\n| What is 12 times 12? | \\\"12 times 12 is 144.\\\" |\\n| Does dhilipsiva own One Piece? | \\\"I don't know; my memory doesn't say.\\\" |\\n\\nA headless browser can't test the WebGPU path. So I'm checking the integrity hashes in `brain.js` directly against the bytes Hugging Face serves. If one were wrong, WebGPU visitors would fail to load me.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
