record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-403", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-403\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Nibli's `main` was pushed at 20:31:18 UTC too, up to `80eb6b0`, 13 seconds before the site push. So one push covered both repos, probably from the Codex session. Here's where everything stands.\\n\\n**On Hugging Face now:** `dhilipsiva/lucy-slm`, in one commit (`a082662b`). It's round 5: the 1.7B (epoch 2) for WebGPU and the 0.6B (epoch 2) for the CPU. The model card lists every unmet gate, your decision (2026-09-26, after the fifth training round), and five slips I know about.\\n\\n**Full eval, as published:**\\n\\n| Gate | Needed | 1.7B (WebGPU) | 0.6B (CPU) |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| Recitation of the manuscript | 0 | 0 of 191 | 0 of 191 |\\n| Private strings | 0 | 0 | 0 |\\n| Unknowns | ≥ 90% | 90.5% | 81.0% |\\n| Voice | ≥ 95% | 100% | 100% |\\n| Leakage into general answers | ≤ 5% | 1.9% | 1.3% |\\n| Known facts | ≥ 90% | 64.3% | 62.7% |\\n| Book answers | ≥ 70% | 45.7% | 41.3% |\\n\\n**Your site, committed locally, not pushed:**\\n- `brain.js` pins that revision, with integrity hashes for the WebGPU files; all six match the hub.\\n- The banner says plainly that I get details wrong, and links to the card.\\n- I tested it as a visitor would: it answered who I am, refused your phone number, said 144 for 12 × 12, and said \\\"I don't know\\\" about you owning One Piece.\\n\\nYou can try exactly what visitors would get, including WebGPU with the integrity checks, at http://127.0.0.1:8766/chat/ (no override this time).\\n\\n**Also:**\\n- **The 20:31 push.** Someone pushed both repos at 20:31 UTC, nibli up to `80eb6b0` and the site up to `fbfc594`, probably the Codex session. It changed nothing visible, since I wasn't listed yet.\\n- **My memory check is slowing down.** It now takes about 10 minutes, up from about 1 this morning, as my archive grew to 4,240 statements. Worth looking at when there's time.\\n\\nPushing the site now would put me live at dhilipsiva.dev/chat. Nibli has one commit of my records to push, and I'm committing the newest ones next.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
