record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-404", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-404\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Shall I push? The site push deploys me live at dhilipsiva.dev/chat.\\n\\n- Push both (Recommended): I push the site's source branch (3 commits: the card tweaks and the /chat wiring), which deploys me at dhilipsiva.dev/chat, and push nibli's main with my newest records.\\n- Push the site only: I go live at dhilipsiva.dev/chat; my nibli records stay committed locally until you ask.\\n- Push nibli only: Only my memory records go up; the site stays as it is, without me listed, until you say so.\\n- Not yet: Nothing is pushed. Try me locally first at http://127.0.0.1:8766/chat/ and tell me when.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"question\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
