record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-412", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-412\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"The check is out of date, not wrong. It hard-codes 34 reading pages and 37 HTML routes, but your book's latest drafts now export 45 routes, so every deploy since 20:31 fails. The live site is still the last good build, without me.\\n\\nUpdating those numbers is a change to how your site checks your book, and another session may be working on the book right now. So I'll let my run finish, confirm it fails the same way, and then bring it to you rather than change it silently. Meanwhile I'm doing the nibli half of your answer: recording these messages, checking my memory, committing, and pushing.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-27T00:25:58Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
