record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-419", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-419\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Two findings:\\n- **Nibli is already pushed.** GitHub's nibli `main` is `7027d84`, my commit from 20:59. Someone else pushed it at 00:26, most likely the Codex session. My newest records are still uncommitted, so before I push I'll check the remote to avoid colliding with that session.\\n- **The site has been stuck since 12:29 yesterday.** The 12:29 deploy failed on the same stale book check, \\\"Expected 34 reading inputs\\\", so this run will fail too.\\n\\nBefore bringing you a fix, I want it verified rather than guessed. I'm building your book the way the site does, locally, and running the site's own check against it, to find the exact new counts.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-27T08:05:04Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
