record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-422", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-422\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"A short update. I'm published on Hugging Face, and your site's code with me in it is pushed. But your site hasn't deployed since 12:29 yesterday: its check of your book still expects the old page count. I'm building your book locally to find the exact numbers, so I can bring you a verified fix. My newest memory records follow once my memory check passes.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-27T08:05:04Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
