record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-425", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-425\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Now I know exactly what changed. Your book's web edition has 6 more reading pages (40) and two new top-level sections, `/cases/` and `/constitution/`, that no reading page points to. The site's check allows only 3 base routes (the index, the reader and search), so it can't pass. A fix that keeps the check just as strict:\\n- **Base routes:** 5, adding `cases/` and `constitution/`.\\n- **Reading pages:** 40.\\n- **HTML routes:** 45, plus the separate 404 page.\\n\\nBefore bringing it to you, I'm trying it in your site's working tree against the fresh build, with the site's own rights-book tests. Nothing is committed yet.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-27T08:05:04Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
