record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-435", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-435\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"All 10 of the site's rights-book tests pass with the fix, including the header, footer and navigation checks on all 46 pages. The fix is two files, left uncommitted:\\n- `scripts/rights_book.py` gains the two new base routes, `cases/` and `constitution/`, and the counts of 40 reading pages and 45 routes.\\n- `tests/test_rights_book.py` expects 46 documents, up from 38.\\n\\nThe check stays exactly as strict; it just matches your book as it is now. I reran the deploy's own steps on a fresh build of your book at `96148b2c`: mount, zola build, `llms.txt`, the navigation graft, the check and the tests all pass.\\n\\nThis is outside what you approved: you approved pushing my commits, not changing how your site checks your book. And pushing it deploys your book's latest drafts as well, including the new `/cases/` and `/constitution/` sections, since the site deliberately tracks the book's `main`.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-27T08:05:04Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
