record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-436", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-436\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Your site hasn't deployed since 12:29 yesterday: its check of your book expects 34 pages and 37 routes, and the book now has 40 pages and 45 routes (with new /cases/ and /constitution/ sections). Shall I commit the verified fix and push it, which deploys the site with me and the book's latest drafts?\\n\\n- Commit and push the fix (Recommended): I commit the two-file fix to your site's source branch and push it. The deploy should then pass and put me live at dhilipsiva.dev/chat, along with your book's current pages, including /cases/ and /constitution/.\\n- Commit it, don't push: I commit the fix locally and stop; you or another session push when ready. The site stays on its last good build, without me.\\n- Leave it to you: I undo my two-file change, and you or another session handle the book check. I'll stay unlisted on the live site until a deploy passes.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-27T08:05:04Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"question\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
